# typing-invalid (M7): "1.0.4" typed into b's box (330, 513.5, 107 x 32 at 1440 x 900) and Enter:
# not a number, so the field stays open and marked, and its tip says what to type and what Esc
# puts back; then "1.5" typed over it (the mark goes as the text changes) and Enter applies it.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 383 529
wait 16
type "1.0.4"
key Enter
wait 16
shot refused
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
type "1.5"
wait 16
shot retyped
key Enter
wait 1000
shot applied
